-- Dhyanam: meaning was the old one-verse dhyanam with its avahanam; the mantra is three verses. The instruction still had her being invited here, and the philosophy quoted "susthira bhava me gehe", which is not in it.
update public.pooja_steps set meaning_en = 'Lakshmi, daughter of the king of the ocean of milk, queen of the house of Sri Ranga, served by all the wives of the gods as their maids, the one small flame that lights the world, by whose gentle glance Brahma, Indra and Shiva gained their glory: I salute you, born of the lotus, mistress of the household of the three worlds, dear to Mukunda. She who sits on the lotus, broad-hipped, with eyes as long as lotus petals, deep-navelled, full-breasted, in a white upper cloth; Lakshmi, bathed by the great elephants of heaven from golden pots set with jewels; lotus in hand and joined with every auspiciousness: may she always live in my house. Seated on the lotus, lotus in hand, garlanded with lotuses, risen from the ocean of milk, shining the colour of milk and dressed in cloth as white as milk, beloved of Hari: with devotion I picture her in this lovely kalasham. In this kalasham I meditate on Sri Varalakshmi.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Dhyanam'
   and meaning_en is distinct from 'Lakshmi, daughter of the king of the ocean of milk, queen of the house of Sri Ranga, served by all the wives of the gods as their maids, the one small flame that lights the world, by whose gentle glance Brahma, Indra and Shiva gained their glory: I salute you, born of the lotus, mistress of the household of the three worlds, dear to Mukunda. She who sits on the lotus, broad-hipped, with eyes as long as lotus petals, deep-navelled, full-breasted, in a white upper cloth; Lakshmi, bathed by the great elephants of heaven from golden pots set with jewels; lotus in hand and joined with every auspiciousness: may she always live in my house. Seated on the lotus, lotus in hand, garlanded with lotuses, risen from the ocean of milk, shining the colour of milk and dressed in cloth as white as milk, beloved of Hari: with devotion I picture her in this lovely kalasham. In this kalasham I meditate on Sri Varalakshmi.';
update public.pooja_steps set philosophy_en = 'Mama vasatu grihe, "may she live in my house". The dhyanam asks for residence, not a visit, and asks it before she has even been invited. That is why the next day needs a step of its own to send her back: she was never asked to leave.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Dhyanam'
   and philosophy_en is distinct from 'Mama vasatu grihe, "may she live in my house". The dhyanam asks for residence, not a visit, and asks it before she has even been invited. That is why the next day needs a step of its own to send her back: she was never asked to leave.';
update public.pooja_steps set instruction_en = 'Close your eyes and hold the form in mind as the three verses draw it: risen from the ocean of milk, seated on the lotus with a lotus in her hand, bathed by elephants from golden pots, dressed in white, dear to Hari. The last line pictures her in this kalasham; she is invited two steps later, once the thread is in place. Done once, on the first day only.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Dhyanam'
   and instruction_en is distinct from 'Close your eyes and hold the form in mind as the three verses draw it: risen from the ocean of milk, seated on the lotus with a lotus in her hand, bathed by elephants from golden pots, dressed in white, dear to Hari. The last line pictures her in this kalasham; she is invited two steps later, once the thread is in place. Done once, on the first day only.';
update public.pooja_steps set instruction_ta = 'கண்களை மூடி, மூன்று ஸ்லோகங்களும் வர்ணிக்கும் வடிவத்தை மனதில் நிறுத்தவும் — பாற்கடலில் தோன்றியவள், தாமரையில் அமர்ந்து கையில் தாமரை ஏந்தியவள், யானைகளால் பொற்குடங்களில் நீராட்டப்படுபவள், வெண்ணிற ஆடை அணிந்தவள், ஹரிக்குப் பிரியமானவள். கடைசி வரி அவளை இந்தக் கலசத்தில் தியானிக்கிறது; சரடு வைக்கப்பட்ட பின், இரண்டு படிகள் கழித்து ஆவாஹனம் செய்யப்படுகிறது. இது முதல் நாளில் மட்டும் ஒரு முறை.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Dhyanam'
   and instruction_ta is distinct from 'கண்களை மூடி, மூன்று ஸ்லோகங்களும் வர்ணிக்கும் வடிவத்தை மனதில் நிறுத்தவும் — பாற்கடலில் தோன்றியவள், தாமரையில் அமர்ந்து கையில் தாமரை ஏந்தியவள், யானைகளால் பொற்குடங்களில் நீராட்டப்படுபவள், வெண்ணிற ஆடை அணிந்தவள், ஹரிக்குப் பிரியமானவள். கடைசி வரி அவளை இந்தக் கலசத்தில் தியானிக்கிறது; சரடு வைக்கப்பட்ட பின், இரண்டு படிகள் கழித்து ஆவாஹனம் செய்யப்படுகிறது. இது முதல் நாளில் மட்டும் ஒரு முறை.';

-- Padyam, Arghyam & Achamaniyam: meaning paraphrased other verses and left out the madhuparkam; instruction and philosophy counted three courtesies where the mantra offers four.
update public.pooja_steps set meaning_en = 'Brought from the Ganga and the other rivers, with sandal and flowers: I give you water for the feet, goddess; be gracious, supreme mistress. Brought from the river Ganga and held in a golden pot: receive the arghyam I give, you who grant the blessing of sons and grandsons. Clear, cool water, you whose lotus face is serene: receive it to sip, beloved of the one whose banner is Garuda. Mahalakshmi, great goddess, joined with honey, ghee and curd: receive this madhuparkam, beloved of Madhusudana. To Sri Varalakshmi, salutations: I offer each in turn.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Padyam, Arghyam & Achamaniyam'
   and meaning_en is distinct from 'Brought from the Ganga and the other rivers, with sandal and flowers: I give you water for the feet, goddess; be gracious, supreme mistress. Brought from the river Ganga and held in a golden pot: receive the arghyam I give, you who grant the blessing of sons and grandsons. Clear, cool water, you whose lotus face is serene: receive it to sip, beloved of the one whose banner is Garuda. Mahalakshmi, great goddess, joined with honey, ghee and curd: receive this madhuparkam, beloved of Madhusudana. To Sri Varalakshmi, salutations: I offer each in turn.';
update public.pooja_steps set philosophy_en = 'The first three are older than any temple: they are what a household in a hot country did for anyone who reached the door. The madhuparkam, honey mixed with curd and ghee, is the honour beyond them, set before the guest the house most wished to receive. The pooja keeps all four unchanged.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Padyam, Arghyam & Achamaniyam'
   and philosophy_en is distinct from 'The first three are older than any temple: they are what a household in a hot country did for anyone who reached the door. The madhuparkam, honey mixed with curd and ghee, is the honour beyond them, set before the guest the house most wished to receive. The pooja keeps all four unchanged.';
update public.pooja_steps set instruction_en = 'The courtesies given to any guest who arrives on foot: water for the feet, water for the hands, water to sip, and then the madhuparkam, honey and curd with ghee. Pour a spoonful into the uddharani at each and empty it into the plate.', updated_at = now()
 where pooja_id = 'varalakshmi_vratham' and step_title_en = 'Padyam, Arghyam & Achamaniyam'
