-- Vastram, Abharanam & Mangalyam: meaning was the old cloth / ornament / heated-gold verses; instruction put the ornaments before the mangalyam, which the mantra offers second.
update public.pooja_steps set meaning_en = 'A fine pair of heavenly garments and a lovely bodice: Varalakshmi, great goddess, receive what I offer. Set with the auspicious gem, with pearls and coral: receive the mangalasutra given to you, beloved of Hari. You who are adorned with jewelled earrings, armlets, necklaces and bangles: receive these precious ornaments, treasury of compassion. To Sri Varalakshmi, salutations: I offer the cloth, the thread for the neck, and the ornaments.', updated_at = now()
